<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="physics" id="physics"><mxGraphModel dx="1250" dy="620" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1250" pageHeight="620" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="Physics-informed loss terms (computed on generated windows in physical units)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#444444;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1000" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Generated window&#xa;(256 time steps, 14 channels)&#xa;scaled values" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="200" width="170" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="Inverse scaling&#xa;back to A, V, km/h,&#xa;SOC points" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="200" width="150" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3" target="n4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="1. SOC to current (Coulomb counting)&#xa;Delta SOC between the first and last step of the window&#xa;vs integral of current (trapezoid) x 100 / (60 Ah x 3600 s)&#xa;squared difference, divided by a real-data reference, weight 0.4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="40" width="480" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="2. Velocity to acceleration&#xa;finite-difference derivative of velocity (km/h to m/s)&#xa;vs the generated acceleration channel&#xa;squared difference, divided by a real-data reference, weight 0.03" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="170" width="480" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="3. Plausibility range, weight 5.0&#xa;(a) impossible values: SOC outside 0 to 100, negative speed&#xa;(b) window mean of every channel and the window Delta SOC must lie in&#xa;the 1st to 99th percentile band of real windows&#xa;(Delta SOC -7.9 to -0.1, mean current -68.8 to -1.7 A); squared excess" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="300" width="480" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n4" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n4" target="n7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n4" target="n8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="Added to the CycleGAN&#xa;generator loss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="200" width="190" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="Limits seen in the results:&#xa;term 1 only sees the two endpoint SOC values, so a window whose SOC oscillates and returns to its start satisfies it.&#xa;Term 3 constrains window averages, not the signal between." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="1160" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>